íNameDateAugust 22, 2025TitleUPDATE 14 ğŸ’ƒImagerbxassetid://99960162184192Codepatchnotes_contractsChangesscriptğŸ’ƒ EMOTESDescriptionEmotes are finally here!RUse an emote to express yourself, react to a funny moment, or for.. other reasons!bEmotes can be purchased from the Daily Shop! Every day, new emotes will show up in the Daily Shop!@Your first ever emote can be claimed for FREE in the Daily Shop!”You can equip emotes, view all of your emotes, & take a peak at your Emote Wheel by heading over to the Weapons page and clicking the Career button!Emotes temporarily grant third-person camera access. Don't worry, though, we already made sure that this won't affect gameplay. Enemies behind walls can not be seen, heard, or smelled while emoting. No need to worry about enemies using emotes to gain an unfair advantage!»To use an emote, simply hold [T] on desktop, [DPadRight] on controller, or tap the [emote button] on mobile! All of these keybinds / buttons can be customized, just like any other action!ŒNOTE: The Emote Wheel is not available until you have your very first emote. Head over to the Daily Shop to claim your first emote for FREE!	Thumbnailrbxassetid://133776507729331'Two individuals partaking in a "selfie"ğŸ¡ BATTLEGROUND*Battleground has been completely revamped!¸Battleground, a privatized facility, serves as the final stronghold securing humanity's future â€” a result of the 'In Unity' program, a rare alliance between the two rival companies..Made by @GreatGuyBoom!vNOTE: You can still play the original version of Battleground in Private Servers â€” now known as Legacy Battleground!rbxassetid://102473488579867-A preview of the brand new "Battleground" mapğŸ—º MAP CONTRACTSMap contracts are finally here!@You can now earn FREE rewards just by playing on different maps!UComplete a map's contract to earn keys, charm capsules, wrap boxes, & finisher packs!~Play on a map for long enough and you'll earn a mini diorama version of the map as a universal charm for all of your weapons!!¢Check out the brand new map contracts by heading over to the Weapons page, going to the Career section, clicking the Maps button, and then pick your favorite map!rbxassetid://97463636950154One of the new "Diorama" charmsğŸ¯ WEAPON CONTRACTS%New weapon contract rewards are here!Every weapon now has a brand new chibi charm reward! Play with your favorite weapon for long enough and you'll earn a cute little chibi charm!OYou can now also earn the brand new, Mythical Dark Matter wrap for each weapon!tThese are the final rewards for these types of contracts. Once you complete these, you've truly mastered the weapon!LHead over to the Weapons page and click on the Contracts button to see more!rbxassetid://116305199539393:The new "Dark Matter" wrap & one of the new "Chibi" charmsğŸ¬ VIDEO ADSPNew Video Ad Rewards â€” You can now watch quick video ads to earn FREE rewards!nThe rewards include keys & the brand new, exclusive 3D Glasses charm, Glamour wrap, & Director's Cut finisher!9Claim these free rewards now in the Shop page's Home tab!rbxassetid://1081678124580360A preview of the new free rewards you could earn	ğŸ›’ SHOP<The Messis wrap has been replaced by the new Triplaser wrap!EThe Sunset Sparkle wrap has been replaced by the new Shadow Ink wrap!VThe Legendary Key Bundle now contains the brand new Mythical Key Bow skin for the Bow!VThe Ultra Key Bundle now contains the brand new Mythical Keynade skin for the Grenade!rbxassetid://121709466235876-One of the brand new key skins, the "Keynade"ğŸ¨ COSMETICS9atorix â€” Eliminate @a2rix to earn this brand new charm!>philhood â€” Eliminate @philhood to earn this brand new charm!,The Camera Flashbang skin has been revamped!rbxassetid://793596616413755The new "Beggar" wrap. Don't ask me how you get this.ğŸ›¡ï¸ PRIVATE SERVERS=New Baseplate Map â€” Now available for Private Servers only!mNow that all of the brand new gamemodes have released, you can play any of them in a Private Server for free!iAre there any commands, tools, changes, or secret maps you'd like to see in Private Servers? Let us know!rbxassetid://705339873379507A glimpse of the new "Baseplate" map in Private ServersğŸ”« BALANCE CHANGESBalancingOverviewGrenade LauncherGunbladeRPGDaggersEnergy Pistols	Flare GunHandgun	SlingshotSprayChainsawKnifeBowMinigunPaintball GunSniperRevolver
Battle AxeFists	FlashbangMedkitAssault RifleShotgunShorty
Freeze RayJump PadºğŸ“ "Many projectile weapons now no longer benefit from the auto-latency-redirection system. This system used to redirect projectiles in an effort to make high ping play more enjoyable"«ğŸ“ "Most weapons now no longer reset their simpler cooldowns on equip, such as shooting a gun. This means that strategies such as Sniper + Fists are no longer abuseable"ÍğŸ“ "Semi-automatic weapons now benefit from "input queueing" â€” shooting while on cooldown will queue the input to go through as soon as the cooldown is lifted, resulting in more consistent shots & DPS"Header~ğŸ“ "The recent firerate nerf made the Assault Rifle not as enjoyable to play, we're shifting the nerf to a different metric"$ğŸ”» Damage decreased from 13 â†’ 121ğŸ’ª Shoot cooldown decreased from 0.11s â†’ 0.1s^ğŸ“ "The Bow's high charge damage and high mobility encouraged frustrating, passive gameplay"ZğŸ”» Charge damage changed from (50% / 100% / 150% / 240%) â†’ (100% / 125% / 150% / 200%)BğŸ“ "The Grenade Launcher's splash damage has been underwhelming"+ğŸ’ª Splash damage increased from 35 â†’ 40CğŸ’ª Projectiles are no longer affected by auto-latency-redirectionNğŸ“ "Relying on landing 2 headshots with gun mode has held the Gunblade back"-ğŸ’ª Gun body damage increased from 40 â†’ 451ğŸ’ª Gun critical damage increased from 50 â†’ 55rğŸ›  No longer fires a shot after landing a blade attack that doesn't deal any damage (e.g. against a Riot Shield)|ğŸ›  No longer fires a shot after landing a blade attack that eliminates enemies (e.g. against windows & low health enemies)^ğŸ“ "To keep the Minigun's high raw damage, we've decided to make it less effective at range".ğŸ”» Shoot spread increased from 1.5Â° â†’ 2Â°0ğŸ”» ADS shoot spread increased from 0Â° â†’ 1Â°IğŸ“ "The Paintball Gun dealt too much total damage in a single magazine"&ğŸ”» Max ammo decreased from 20 â†’ 16.ğŸ’ª Max ammo reserve increased from 20 â†’ 24SğŸ“ "It was too easy to dodge the RPG's rockets in the current high-mobility meta"=ğŸ’ª Projectile speed increased from 75studs/s â†’ 100studs/s]ğŸ“ "These changes will help the Shotgun feel more satisfying and consistent with each shot"-ğŸ’ª Shoot spread decreased from 10Â° â†’ 5Â°ğŸ”» Damage dropoff introduced9ğŸ›  Shooting while aiming now automatically stops aiming9ğŸ“ "This strategy was extremely unfair to play against"ğŸ”» Can no longer bypass the shoot cooldown by quick meleeing with Fists (other weapons suffer the same change but the Sniper has been most affected by this)5ğŸ“ "The recent nerfs to the Daggers were too harsh")ğŸ’ª Body damage increased from 15 â†’ 20XğŸ“ "As mentioned before, secondaries should feel reliable enough to quickly switch to"2ğŸ’ª Equip cooldown decreased from 0.85s â†’ 0.45s8ğŸ“ "The Flare Gun's damage has simply been not enough"!ğŸ’ª DPS increased from 40 â†’ 50BğŸ“ "Input Queueing should make the Handgun feel more consistent"%ğŸ’ª Now benefits from input queueingVğŸ“ "The Revolver's quick equip provided no weaknesses to this high damage secondary"1ğŸ”» Equip cooldown increased from 0.45s â†’ 0.7s\ğŸ“ "These changes will help the Shorty feel more satisfying and consistent with each shot"/ğŸ’ª Shoot spread decreased from 15Â° â†’ 7.5Â°~ğŸ“ "While the Slingshot has been in a more balanced state, we want Slingshot players that can actually aim to feel rewarded"-ğŸ’ª Critical damage increased from 7.5 â†’ 9SğŸ“ "The Spray should feel like a reliable sidearm that you can quickly switch to"0ğŸ’ª Shoot cooldown decreased from 0.4s â†’ 0.3s…ğŸ“ "The Battle Axe not only dealt too much damage too easily, but the knockback would also set up free eliminations way too easily")ğŸ”» Spin damage decreased from 40 â†’ 30"ğŸ”» Spin knockback reduced by 50%NğŸ“ "The Chainsaw's ability struggles to compete against other melee options":ğŸ’ª Ability move speed bonus increased from +75% â†’ +85%(ğŸ’ª Max ammo increased from 100 â†’ 150=ğŸ”» Can no longer bypass attack cooldowns via quick meleeing8ğŸ“ "The Knife should feel like a quick, nimble weapon"/ğŸ’ª Equip cooldown decreased from 1s â†’ 0.45smğŸ“ "The Flashbang's high blind duration has always been a problem, especially when 2 can be thrown at once",ğŸ”» Blind duration decreased from 4s â†’ 3s?ğŸ“ "This small change should result in more consistent shots"3ğŸ“ "Jump Pads should be usable for entire rounds"(ğŸ’ª Lifetime increased from 60s â†’ 90sAğŸ“ "The Medkit offers too much value for how easy it is to use".ğŸ”» Full heal amount decreased from 75 â†’ 70/ğŸ”» Quick heal amount decreased from 30 â†’ 25HğŸ’ª Can no longer be interrupted by damage over time (e.g. fire damage)
ğŸ›  OTHERTLimited Gamemodes now cycle much more often instead of every 7 days in the Play page=You can now see which map is your favorite in the Career pageImproved profile cards#Backpacks are now cleanly organized&The Big Onyx map has been added to 3v3&The Onyx map has been removed from 3v3PAmmo drops in specific gamemodes can no longer be picked up if you have max ammoCRiot Shield & Flare Gun has been removed from the Gun Game gamemodeXThe maximum skill disparity allowed in Ranked Parties has been increased from 600 to 800|You can now open the Private Server Controls page using the top bar buttons instead of having to use the hologram near spawnBAdded more visual clarity on the waiting status of matchmade gamesCAdded fun facts in the loading, teleporting, and matchmaking screenğŸ› BUG FIXES_Fixed a bug where shooting while inside of the hurtbox of an enemy wouldn't deal damage to themGFixed a bug where players could see & shoot through walls while slidingZFixed a bug where the Shotgun's shoot cooldown was incorrectly set to 0.8s instead of 0.7s‡Fixed various bugs with projectiles that resulted in weird behavior, especially for weapons such as Grenade Launcher, RPG, & Freeze RayNFixed a bug where explosive projectiles would bounce off of Subspace TripmineszFixed a bug where certain weapons, but most notably Melee weapons, could no longer destroy windows, explosive barrels, etcSFixed a bug where the Minigun would randomly stop firing/charging at low frameratesrFixed a rare bug where players with a Riot Shield could softlock duels by leaving during the round start countdownHFixed a visual bug with the Shotgun's damage numbers in the Weapons pageQFixed a visual bug where the RNG Dice would stay invisible for too long after usekFixed a visual bug that caused charms to float in the air after placing down Subspace Tripmines & Jump PadsJFixed a visual bug where charms wouldn't appear on unequipped Riot ShieldscFixed a bug where Satchels could fall through the map if attached to Trowel bricks that disappearedjFixed a bug where certain Trowel skins caused unintentional behavior when interacting with hardened bricks]Fixed a bug in the Graveyard map where a specific part of the roof of the chapel was slipperySFixed various visual bugs, out of bounds bugs, & spawn locations in the Station map1Fixed various visual bugs in the Construction map<Fixed various visual bugs & spawn locations in the Docks map6Fixed various spawn locations in the Big Backrooms map4Fixed a visual bug with the Shooting Range map image…Fixed a bug in the Big Arena map where invisible barriers would impact with projectiles, allow you to place jump pads on them, & moreÀFixed a bug where projectiles would bounce off of the invisible water barriers in Splash, Big Splash, Legacy Splash, & Docks, as well as the window sills in Station, Graveyard, & Big Graveyard*Fixed various visual bugs within the lobbyjFixed a bug where the ESP UI in Easy Exploits would be invisible while playing & while the HUD is disabledOFixed a small visual bug with the lighting effects in the Chicken Game gamemodenFixed a bug where players would be eliminated while in the lobby after a Chicken Game duel ends on a red lightbFixed a bug with the Sensei Bot & Nosniy Bot boss fights where the duel wouldn't end after you win\Fixed a bug where the Juggernaut would always be the same player every time a new duel began|Fixed a bug in Arcade Servers where Explosive Barrels would still spawn for newly joined players even after they've explodedYFixed a bug where players could earn Keys from playing Gun Game inside of Private ServersUFixed a visual bug where ammo & health drops that you drop wouldn't be visible to youpFixed an extremely rare bug where some players wouldn't receive a rank after completing their 10 placement duelsrFixed a bug in Ranked where players would receive more ELO than intended for making the entire enemy team ragequitZFixed a visual bug where Archnemesis players would incorrectly show off as Nemesis players]Fixed a visual bug with the Skull Launcher skin where the skull would poke out of the chamber:Fixed a visual bug with the Repulsor skin's hologram sight5Fixed a small visual bug with the Crude Gunblade skin(Fixed a visual bug with the Shotkey skinGFixed visual bugs with the Wrapped Freeze Ray and Wrapped Shotgun skins<Fixed visual bugs with the Apex Rifle and Apex Pistols skins(Fixed a visual bug with the Ray Gun skin2Fixed a visual bug when wrapping the Hand Gun skinFixed a visual bug where unobtainable weapons would incorrectly show that you've completed all available contracts for the weapon during a duelgPotentially a visual bug that caused weapons in the hotbar to duplicate multiple times while spectatingLFixed a small visual bug with inspecting side contract rewards during a duelPFixed a few visual bugs for the winners screen at the end of Arcade Server duels\Fixed a bug where you could bypass the maximum amount of wins allowed in a day for duel padssFixed a bug where the Broom Ride finisher would briefly create an invisible barrier that players could collide withOFixed a bug where the Sensei & Co. team would always win the round's tiebreakerVFixed a bug where the Shooting Range wouldn't be available after a matchmade duel endsxFixed a bug in Private Servers where players couldn't start a duel with an unbalanced number of players on each duel padˆFixed a bug where players would receive the wrong item from the Daily Shop if they purchased something right as the Daily Shop refreshed~Fixed a visual bug where your damage dealt was displayed innaccurately in the end game screen after an Arcade Server duel endsğŸ“œ A NOTE FROM THE DEVELOPERS?Hey everyone, it's been a while since the last developer notes!–We hope you all enjoyed the new gamemodes and the recent updates. We enjoyed working on them and providing a unique twist to how RIVALS can be played.’This mini-update is to quickly address all of the bugs, balance changes, and other necessary changes we wanted to make after the gamemodes update.cMoving forward, we're going to start dialing in on new content that all players can enjoy together.‚Which means.. Season 1 is coming very soon. This update will NOT be just for the competitive players. Stay tuned for more details.␀ô;␀␀
